async function applyReceipt(receipt){if(receipt?.schema==='NPCDexROMReversalReceipt/1'){inspectRomReversal(receipt);commitChange('Confirm ROM Reversal',()=>{data.romReversalResolutions[receipt.historyId]=receipt.receiptId;data.implementationReceipts.push(structuredClone(receipt))},{receiptId:receipt.receiptId,requiresRomReversal:false});return}const requests=await inspectReceipt(receipt),pointIds=[...new Set(Object.values(requests).flatMap(r=>r.references.pointIds))];commitChange('Reconcile Implemented ROM Changes',()=>{for(const entry of receipt.entries){const currentPlan=Object.values(data.changePlans).find(p=>p.id===entry.planId);if(JSON.stringify(requestSignature(currentPlan))!==JSON.stringify(requestSignature(requests[entry.planId])))throw Error('Change plan changed during reconciliation.');for(const patch of entry.patches){if(!sameState(readPath(data,patch.path),patch.before))throw Error('Content changed during reconciliation.');writePath(data,patch.path,patch.after)}for(const f of entry.resolvedFeedback||[]){const current=data.annotations[f.key];if(!current||current.flag!==f.flag||current.note!==f.note||!!current.critical!==!!f.critical)throw Error('Feedback changed during reconciliation.');Object.assign(current,{flag:false,critical:false,note:'',testStatus:'unreviewed'})}const plan=Object.values(data.changePlans).find(p=>p.id===entry.planId);plan.workflow='implemented';plan.implementedIntent=plan.intent;if(plan.intent==='UPDATE')plan.intent='FINAL';plan.receiptId=receipt.receiptId;plan.implementedAt=receipt.implementedAt||new Date().toISOString()}resetTesting(pointIds);data.implementationReceipts.push(structuredClone(receipt))},{receiptId:receipt.receiptId,pointIds,requiresRomReversal:true,romBeforeHash:receipt.romBeforeHash,romAfterHash:receipt.romAfterHash});render();}
function historyHTML(){return [...data.history].reverse().map(e=>`<article class="history-entry"><strong>${esc(e.label)}</strong><small>${esc(e.timestamp)} · ${e.patches.length} recorded changes${e.undoOf?' · Reversal':''}</small>${e.requiresRomReversal?'<p class="error">Undo here restores NPCDex data. The coding agent must also reverse the corresponding ROM change.</p>':''}<details><summary>Before / After and Source Target</summary><pre>${esc(JSON.stringify({target:e.target,pointIds:e.pointIds,patches:e.patches},(k,v)=>k==='dataUrl'?'[Embedded image: '+v.length+' characters]':v,2))}</pre></details><button data-undo="${esc(e.id)}">Undo Recorded Change</button></article>`).join('')||'<p>No committed changes yet.</p>'}
