function titleCase(text){return String(text||'').replace(/[\p{L}\p{N}]+(?:[’'][\p{L}\p{N}]+)*/gu,word=>/^(PC|NPC|TV|ID|HGSS|ROM|LS\d*|T\d+[A-Z0-9]*)$/.test(word)?word:word[0].toUpperCase()+word.slice(1).toLowerCase())}
